  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Ginnie crossbody keeps a low profile and looks great doing it. Crafted in refined grain leather with a softly rounded zip top closure and an adjustable strap, it's slim enough to wear all day and polished enough to keep wearing all night. No spotlight necessary.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> PVC</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable crossbody strap with 24&quot; drop at longest</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (black, meringue); silver hardware (elm, pale sapphirine, crisp sky, fresh peach)</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 10.5&quot; (L) x 6&quot; (H) x 2.60&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
